<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Tuesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>* denotes new result</p>
<p>Fourth Round</p>
<p>*  Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Sandrine Testud (France) 4-6</p>
<p>7-5 12-10</p>
<p>* Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) beat Maria Alejandra Vento</p>
<p>(Venezuela) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>* 3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 11-Mary Joe Fernandez</p>
<p>(U.S.) 5-7 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>* Anna Kournikova (Russia) beat Helena Sukova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>2-6 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>8-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat 9-Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>6-1 6-3</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium)</p>
<p>6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 6-0</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
</text>
